# Brute Force Solution

For every character in the ransom note:

Search the magazine.

When found,

mark that character as used.

Repeat.

---

## Java Code

```java
class Solution {

    public boolean canConstruct(String ransomNote, String magazine) {

        boolean[] used = new boolean[magazine.length()];

        for (int i = 0; i < ransomNote.length(); i++) {

            boolean found = false;

            for (int j = 0; j < magazine.length(); j++) {

                if (!used[j] &&
                    ransomNote.charAt(i) == magazine.charAt(j)) {

                    used[j] = true;
                    found = true;
                    break;
                }

            }

            if (!found) {
                return false;
            }

        }

        return true;
    }
}
```

---

## Complexity

| Time | Space |
|------|-------|
| O(M × N) | O(N) |

Too slow.

