# Complexity Analysis

## Array Solution

| Operation | Complexity |
|-----------|------------|
| Count Magazine | O(M) |
| Consume Characters | O(N) |

Overall

```text
Time

O(M + N)
```

```text
Space

O(1)
```

Because the array size is fixed at 26.

---

## HashMap Solution

| Time | Space |
|------|-------|
| O(M + N) | O(K) |

Where `K` is the number of distinct characters.

