# Common Mistakes

## Mistake 1

Building frequencies from the ransom note first.

The magazine is the resource.

Always count the available characters.

---

## Mistake 2

Checking only character existence.

Wrong

```text
Magazine

ab
```

Need

```text
abb
```

Character

```
b
```

exists,

but not enough times.

Frequencies matter.

---

## Mistake 3

Waiting until the end to detect failure.

Instead,

return immediately when a count becomes negative.

This avoids unnecessary work.

